Drag & Drop in Compose: Reorderable Lists & Swipe to Delete
Building interactive, gesture-driven UIs is a hallmark of modern Android apps. Jetpack Compose makes implementing drag-and-drop interactions elegant and performant. This guide covers the essential patterns for reorderable lists and swipe-to-delete functionality. The detectDragGesturesAfterLongPress modifier enables drag interactions after a long press: var offsetX by remember { mutableFloatStateOf(0f) } var offsetY by remember { mutableFloatStateOf(0f) }
